 msgid "With \"auto\", LibreELEC Hades looks in its update channel every six hours, downloads a new version and installs it at the next start; with \"manual\", it only tells you, and \"Available Versions\" looks now. A version is taken only when it is signed by LibreELEC Hades, is newer than this one and comes over HTTPS, whole and unchanged."
 msgstr ""
